WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Material identity. Confirm the species, plant part and traceable starting lot.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Pretreatment. Drying or size reduction may prepare the material for extraction.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Extraction. A selected medium transfers soluble constituents from the material.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Separation. Filtration or centrifugation can remove suspended solids.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Concentrate / purify. Remove solvent; use selective separation only where needed.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Dry / formulate. Some routes produce powders; others remain liquid.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Quality review. Check identity, composition and agreed acceptance criteria.

8
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
No universal recipe. Steps vary by product. This schematic is not a real facility.
